    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184550/extras/b124e638db84cfda1c9556215b06fb1a.avif?t=1746944988\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Gizmo, your little robo-homie, you'll navigate through increasingly complex environments by writing Python code, transforming programming concepts into tangible puzzle solutions. Perfect for coding beginners and enthusiasts alike, this game makes learning Python fun and practical while solving engaging problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184550/extras/9cacb53566730ed546ac7891e00fcafa.avif?t=1746944988\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 22-level Campaign introduces programming fundamentals through practical challenges. Starting with basic movement instructions, you'll progress to advanced concepts like functions, arrays, and algorithmic thinking \u2013 all while discovering new game mechanics like barriers, hazards, and interactive stations. Each level introduces new coding concepts that build upon previous knowledge, creating a natural learning progression that's both educational and entertaining. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184550/extras/89f47af6d8fa2538b4eed4c20d122b98.avif?t=1746944988\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want something different? Puzzle mode breaks the mold with novel challenges unlike standard maze levels. Test your coding skills with tricky puzzles featuring sliding tiles, memory match cards, hidden traps, slippery oil slicks, and more. These brain-teasers will push your problem-solving abilities in new directions while reinforcing your Python programming skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184550/extras/a01a9d3a8c0d6ead31f3a635a159f664.avif?t=1746944988\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Endurance mode's procedurally generated mazes where the goal is to survive and conquer as many levels as possible before the complexity overwhelms you. Over time, your run increases in difficulty, offering infinite opportunities to refine your code and strategies. Discover and collect Trinkets \u2013 special items that augment Gizmo's capabilities in unique ways, helping you push further into the challenge and climb the global leaderboards. How far can your code take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184550/extras/b124e638db84cfda1c9556215b06fb1a.avif?t=1746944988\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Gizmo, your little robo-homie, you'll navigate through increasingly complex environments by writing Python code, transforming programming concepts into tangible puzzle solutions. Perfect for coding beginners and enthusiasts alike, this game makes learning Python fun and practical while solving engaging problems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184550/extras/9cacb53566730ed546ac7891e00fcafa.avif?t=1746944988\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 22-level Campaign introduces programming fundamentals through practical challenges. Starting with basic movement instructions, you'll progress to advanced concepts like functions, arrays, and algorithmic thinking \u2013 all while discovering new game mechanics like barriers, hazards, and interactive stations. Each level introduces new coding concepts that build upon previous knowledge, creating a natural learning progression that's both educational and entertaining. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184550/extras/89f47af6d8fa2538b4eed4c20d122b98.avif?t=1746944988\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want something different? Puzzle mode breaks the mold with novel challenges unlike standard maze levels. Test your coding skills with tricky puzzles featuring sliding tiles, memory match cards, hidden traps, slippery oil slicks, and more. These brain-teasers will push your problem-solving abilities in new directions while reinforcing your Python programming skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3184550/extras/a01a9d3a8c0d6ead31f3a635a159f664.avif?t=1746944988\" data-has-big width=800 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into Endurance mode's procedurally generated mazes where the goal is to survive and conquer as many levels as possible before the complexity overwhelms you. Over time, your run increases in difficulty, offering infinite opportunities to refine your code and strategies. Discover and collect Trinkets \u2013 special items that augment Gizmo's capabilities in unique ways, helping you push further into the challenge and climb the global leaderboards. How far can your code take you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Help Gizmo through increasingly complex mazes using Python code as you learn programming concepts, dodge hazards, and manage resources across campaign, puzzle, and endurance game modes.",
